<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Banish</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: none (no guild or teacher teaches it)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast banish &lt;creature&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster calls on the power of the vortex to take a summoned creature 
back: an elemental, a demon or a devil called up by a summoning spell, or 
a ranger's eagle, twists in pain and dissolves. It is the answer to a conjurer's servants.
</p><p>It only works on creatures that were summoned by magic; on anything else, 
nothing happens. The target resists with its mind, and if the spell fails, 
it turns on you, summoned or not. You must be standing, not fighting. No guild or 
teacher teaches it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
